{"unit_id":"beihzb__dsh-notebook#card-zh","repo":"beihzb/dsh-notebook","commit":"19b27fb3c607e96d0ce677659a6f916e252764ab","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notebook 是面向 DSH Web 会话的 Jupyter 笔记本插件，为每个会话维护独立的笔记本状态和持久内核。它在会话界面加入 Notebook 标签，并向 Agent 提供创建、打开、保存、编辑和运行单元格等工具。用户可以在 Python 或 R 内核中执行代码、查看输出与错误、选择运行环境，并把笔记本保存为 .ipynb 文件。适合需要让 Agent 在数据分析工作区中持续修改和运行代码的用户。Python 内核需要 ipykernel 和 jupyter_client；R 内核需要 IRkernel。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:201-263","lib/index.js:2113-2169","lib/client.js:2017-2021","python/kernel_driver.py:442-455"]}
{"unit_id":"beihzb__dsh-notebook#card-en","repo":"beihzb/dsh-notebook","commit":"19b27fb3c607e96d0ce677659a6f916e252764ab","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notebook adds a Notebook tab to DSH web sessions and keeps a Jupyter kernel per session. Agents can create, edit, run, and save cells, then inspect outputs and errors. Python and R kernels are supported; Python needs ipykernel and jupyter_client, and R needs IRkernel.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:201-263","lib/index.js:2113-2169","lib/client.js:2017-2021","python/kernel_driver.py:442-455"]}
