{"unit_id":"beihzb__dsh-notebook#feature-1","repo":"beihzb/dsh-notebook","commit":"19b27fb3c607e96d0ce677659a6f916e252764ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notebook 的功能「编辑笔记本」：Agent 可新建、打开、保存 .ipynb，并增删或编辑单元格。通过 nb_* 工具操作，输入路径或单元格内容，更新当前会话笔记本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1161-1234","lib/index.js:2145-2208"]}
{"unit_id":"beihzb__dsh-notebook#feature-2","repo":"beihzb/dsh-notebook","commit":"19b27fb3c607e96d0ce677659a6f916e252764ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notebook 的功能「运行代码单元」：Agent 可运行单个或全部代码单元，内核会跨单元保留状态。通过 nb_run_cell 或 nb_run_all 触发，返回运行结果和错误信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2210-2227"]}
{"unit_id":"beihzb__dsh-notebook#feature-3","repo":"beihzb/dsh-notebook","commit":"19b27fb3c607e96d0ce677659a6f916e252764ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notebook 的功能「选择计算内核」：可查看并选择 Python 或 R 环境。通过 nb_kernel_list 和 nb_kernel_select 触发，按内核标识、环境名或解释器路径启动内核。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2264-2282"]}
